WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:03.135
-President Trump
has ordered the Pentagon

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.504
to plan a military parade

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:05.972
while his administration takes

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:08.974
a harsher stance on immigration
and insults DREAMers.

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:11.144
For more on this,
it is time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:14.747 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:19.618
The GOP tax plan will add
$1.5 trillion to the deficit,

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:22.021
and now Republicans are talking
about slashing

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:23.890
safety net programs
to make up for it.

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.792
So, of course, President Trump
wants to throw a bunch of time

00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:29.362
and money at an active theater
that nobody wants --

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.030
a military parade.

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.200
-Looks as if President Trump
will get the military parade

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.635
he wants in Washington.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:38.271
-President Trump's vision
of soldiers marching

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.907
and tanks rolling down
the boulevards of Washington

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.809
is moving closer to reality,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:44.343
and the Pentagon and White House

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:45.711
where officials say they have

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:48.214
begun to plan
a grand military parade.

00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.116
-The marching orders
were this -- I want a parade

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.885
like the one in France,"
said a military official

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.387
who spoke on condition
of anonymity.

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.289
Because the planning discussions

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:57.757
are supposed to remain
confidential,

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.224
this is being worked at

00:00:59.224 --> 00:01:01.727
the highest levels
of the military.

00:01:01.727 --> 00:01:04.664
-That's right.
Trump wants a military parade,

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.799
so you're just going
full dictator now.

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.701
Just "dic" wasn't enough.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:09.902
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:11.738
If you are worried a tank
won't fit

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.439
on Pennsylvania Avenue,
don't worry.

00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:15.208
If it is anything like
Trump's last parade,

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.076
there will be plenty of room.

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.478
[ Laughter, audience groans ]

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:22.582
So a rogue state is developing
nuclear weapons.

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:24.116
Russia is meddling
in our elections.

00:01:24.116 --> 00:01:26.852
The Pentagon just warned that
climate change poses a threat

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:28.655
to half of
all our military sites,

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:31.391
and you have top generals
working on a parade.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:34.527
Man, you a chance to be in
the military, and you dodged it.

00:01:34.527 --> 00:01:36.229
If you want to hold a parade
for something

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.864
you yourself actively avoided,

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:39.999
why not throw an IRS parade

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.435
or a parade of personal
trainers?

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:43.736
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:44.937
What's next?
Are you going to make

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:46.872
the Chairman
of the Joint Chiefs of Staff

00:01:46.872 --> 00:01:48.273
plan your prom?

00:01:48.273 --> 00:01:49.908
But be careful if you do,

00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:51.578
because if it goes
by popular vote,

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:52.945
you're not going to be happy

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.713
with who they choose
for King and Queen.

00:01:54.713 --> 00:01:57.249
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:57.249 --> 00:01:59.686
If it's popular vote.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:02.755
On top of the fact that it would
be a waste of time and money,

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:04.690
there's also the fact
that the Pentagon itself

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:06.025
doesn't even seem to want it,

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.628
because Trump also asked
for a military parade

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:10.429
for his inauguration
and the Pentagon

00:02:10.429 --> 00:02:12.031
didn't seem too psyched.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.000
A Pentagon official wrote
in an internal e-mail

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.336
at the time that the Trump team
"is seriously considering

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:19.038
adding military vehicles
to the inaugural parade."

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:21.974
Later in response to an e-mail
confirming that the Trump team

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:25.111
abandon its efforts, the
official wrote, "Great news."

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:28.281
The Pentagon reacts to Trump the
same way you react to a friend

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:31.251
who cancels a dinner
you didn't want to go to.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.719
"Brad says he can't make it
because he has a kidney stone.

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:36.088
Oh, my God, that's great news."

00:02:36.088 --> 00:02:38.323
So, where exactly would
this parade happen?

00:02:38.323 --> 00:02:40.192
Well, "The Washington Post"
reported that the route

00:02:40.192 --> 00:02:42.628
would pass by a location
close to Trump's heart,

00:02:42.628 --> 00:02:44.163
or rather, his wallet.

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:45.664
Trump has said he would
like it to proceed

00:02:45.664 --> 00:02:47.233
along Pennsylvania Avenue.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:49.435
It would be the same route
as Trump's inaugural parade

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:51.403
and pass by
his family's showpiece,

00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:53.272
Trump International Hotel.

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:55.475
I has always hoped
if the military was surrounding

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:57.844
Trump Hotel, there would be
a general with a bull horn

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.445
saying, "Come out,
Mr. President!

00:02:59.445 --> 00:03:01.481
The game is up!"

00:03:01.481 --> 00:03:03.649
[ As Trump ]
I'm only a Mexican maid,

00:03:03.649 --> 00:03:06.119
and I'm sorry to say he is
not here. Gracias, go away.

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:07.820
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.590
[ Normal voice ] While he is
busy planning a military parade,

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.092
Trump is supposed to be
working out a deal

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:14.426
with congress on immigration.

00:03:14.426 --> 00:03:16.528
Now, Trump claims he wants
to strike a deal,

00:03:16.528 --> 00:03:18.264
but his plan calls
for massive cuts

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:20.533
to family-based immigration
in return for protections

00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:23.001
for DREAMers,
young undocumented immigrants

00:03:23.001 --> 00:03:24.303
brought here as children.

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:26.505
Yesterday, Trump insisted,
without evidence,

00:03:26.505 --> 00:03:28.674
that our immigration laws
are much looser

00:03:28.674 --> 00:03:31.010
than other countries
and claimed that he could give

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:32.878
specific examples
of the countries

00:03:32.878 --> 00:03:34.147
he was referring to.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:35.782
-The world is laughing at us

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:38.417
because they can't believe
these policies.

00:03:38.417 --> 00:03:39.552
They don't have it.

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:41.721
I could name 15 of them
right now.

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.389
-No, you couldn't.

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.791
[ Laughter ]

00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:48.260
-You couldn't name
15 countries period.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.996
[ As Trump ]
There's the U.S., Canada,

00:03:50.996 --> 00:03:52.832
America, China,

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:55.568
China-Da, the USA,

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:58.771
Mexico, Chinatown.

00:03:58.771 --> 00:04:01.707
I want to say Australia,
but it turns out Danny McBride

00:04:01.707 --> 00:04:04.877
just made that up for a movie.
It's not a real place.

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.745
[ Normal voice ] In fact,
even if you gave Trump

00:04:06.745 --> 00:04:09.515
the name of a country,
he couldn't say that country.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:11.083
Like say Namibia.

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:12.251
-Nambia.

00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:13.752
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.752 --> 00:04:15.121
-Tanzania.

00:04:15.121 --> 00:04:16.189
-Tan-zany-a.

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:17.389
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.389 --> 00:04:19.091
-Or the United States.

00:04:19.091 --> 00:04:20.425
-The United Shates.

00:04:20.425 --> 00:04:22.027
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:22.027 --> 00:04:23.496
-Shates.

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:27.833
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:30.736
Now, Republicans and Democrats
both say there's a deal

00:04:30.736 --> 00:04:32.271
to be made
that would protect DREAMers

00:04:32.271 --> 00:04:33.739
while giving Trump
money for his wall,

00:04:33.739 --> 00:04:35.207
but Trump wants more than that.

00:04:35.207 --> 00:04:38.044
His immigration framework calls
for a massive restructuring

00:04:38.044 --> 00:04:39.345
of family-based immigration,

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:41.447
although doesn't call it
family-based immigration.

00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:44.383
He opts as usual for
a much more offensive term.

00:04:44.383 --> 00:04:49.021
-We must replace our current
system of extended family

00:04:49.021 --> 00:04:51.557
chain migration
with a merit-based system.

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:55.394
Legislation that would end
chain migration

00:04:55.394 --> 00:04:57.396
and switch our country

00:04:57.396 --> 00:05:01.200
to a merit-based
immigration system.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:04.169
-It has to be a bill
to end chain migration.

00:05:04.169 --> 00:05:06.472
-Stop calling it
chain migration.

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:07.940
You're talking about families.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.043
Don't make it sound like
there's a new Applebee's

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:12.812
too close to the old Applebee's.

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:14.880
Chain migration
is an insulting way

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.582
to refer to families
staying together.

00:05:16.582 --> 00:05:18.083
When you hang around
with your family,

00:05:18.083 --> 00:05:20.086
nobody calls it chain mutation.

00:05:20.086 --> 00:05:21.354
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.354 --> 00:05:23.522
Look at them, they look like
the three middle figures

00:05:23.522 --> 00:05:25.324
from the evolution of man.

00:05:25.324 --> 00:05:27.560
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.762
-Trump has proposed
a radical shift

00:05:29.762 --> 00:05:32.598
that would cut legal immigration
by 44% annually

00:05:32.598 --> 00:05:35.468
which Democrats and even
many Republicans oppose.

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:38.538
Now, it won't surprise you
to learn that Trump has no idea

00:05:38.538 --> 00:05:40.439
how our current immigration laws
actually work,

00:05:40.439 --> 00:05:42.675
but apparently neither does
his staff.

00:05:42.675 --> 00:05:44.310
His Director
of Legislative Affairs

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.278
Marc Short was
on "Face the Nation" recently

00:05:46.278 --> 00:05:49.047
and tried to justify Trump's use
of the phrase "chain migration"

00:05:49.047 --> 00:05:50.282
by saying this.

00:05:50.282 --> 00:05:51.918 line:0%
-What's happening right now
in our visa system

00:05:51.918 --> 00:05:54.554 line:0%
is you're providing visas
for aunts and uncles

00:05:54.554 --> 00:05:56.155
and siblings
that continue to go on.

00:05:56.155 --> 00:05:57.657
Hence it's called
chain migration.

00:05:57.657 --> 00:05:59.858
-Sounds good,
there's just one problem --

00:05:59.858 --> 00:06:01.593
Aunts and uncles
can't be sponsored

00:06:01.593 --> 00:06:03.896
for family-based green cards
under current law.

00:06:03.896 --> 00:06:05.564
Oh, my God,
do you guys have any idea

00:06:05.564 --> 00:06:06.932
what you're doing over there?

00:06:06.932 --> 00:06:09.702
I bet the White House
is like a CVS after midnight.

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:10.970
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.738
"Excuse me,
where's the toothpaste?"

00:06:12.738 --> 00:06:14.606
"Uh? Unh-unh-unh."

00:06:14.606 --> 00:06:16.575
"How about the deodorant?"

00:06:16.575 --> 00:06:18.411
"Unh-uhh-unh."

00:06:18.411 --> 00:06:20.513
"Do you want me to leave?"
"Uh-huh."

00:06:20.513 --> 00:06:21.780
[ Laughter ]

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.816
And on top of that,
there are already limits

00:06:23.816 --> 00:06:26.652
on the number of visas issued
per year per family category.

00:06:26.652 --> 00:06:28.521
For some relatives,
the wait period for a visa

00:06:28.521 --> 00:06:31.257
is over 13 years, but even
longer for some countries

00:06:31.257 --> 00:06:32.225
with heavy demand.

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:33.392
Siblings in the Philippines

00:06:33.392 --> 00:06:35.494
have to wait at least 23 years
for a visa,

00:06:35.494 --> 00:06:37.563
and Mexican siblings,
at least 20 years.

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:38.530
20 years!

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:40.065
Can you imagine
what would happen

00:06:40.065 --> 00:06:42.668
to a child who was unsupervised
for 20 years?

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:44.003
Oh, right, right,
oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:06:44.003 --> 00:06:45.171
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:48.141
Right. Yep.

00:06:48.141 --> 00:06:51.543
Now, in return
for those massive cuts

00:06:51.543 --> 00:06:53.613
to legal immigration,
Trump has proposed protecting

00:06:53.613 --> 00:06:55.181
about 1.8 million DREAMers,

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:57.016
including some
who did not originally

00:06:57.016 --> 00:06:58.384
sign up for the DACA program.

00:06:58.384 --> 00:07:01.954
Now, many of them might not have
signed up because of fear,

00:07:01.954 --> 00:07:04.623
cost, or because they weren't
sure if they were eligible.

00:07:04.623 --> 00:07:06.392
But on Tuesday,
Trump's Chief of Staff

00:07:06.392 --> 00:07:09.662
John Kelly offered a different,
more insulting explanation.

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:14.300
-There are 690,000 official
DACA registrants,

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.970
and the President sent over

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.471
what amounts to be

00:07:19.471 --> 00:07:23.408
two and a half times that
number, to 1.8 million.

00:07:23.408 --> 00:07:26.712
The difference between
690,000 and 1.8 million

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:29.448
were the people that
some would say were too afraid

00:07:29.448 --> 00:07:31.817
to sign up,
others would say were too lazy

00:07:31.817 --> 00:07:34.287
to get off their asses,
but they didn't sign up.

00:07:34.287 --> 00:07:36.088
<i> -They</i> were too lazy?

00:07:36.088 --> 00:07:39.058
You work for a guy who watches
eight hours of TV a day,

00:07:39.058 --> 00:07:41.193
tweets until noon,
eats cheeseburgers in bed,

00:07:41.193 --> 00:07:43.161
can't read a piece of paper
unless it has pictures

00:07:43.161 --> 00:07:45.297
with his name on it, won't walk
down a flight of stairs,

00:07:45.297 --> 00:07:47.700
and his preferred mode of
transportation is a golf cart.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:48.801
[ Laughter ]

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:50.503
Trump is so lazy,
I wouldn't be surprised

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:53.239
if he had one of those grabbers
so he could reach his Diet Coke

00:07:53.239 --> 00:07:54.739
without getting off the couch.

00:07:54.739 --> 00:07:56.509
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:56.509 --> 00:08:00.579
Now Trump keeps pretending
he wants merit-based immigration

00:08:00.579 --> 00:08:02.982
when he's already made clear
many times what he really wants,

00:08:02.982 --> 00:08:05.618
an immigration system
that takes in more white people

00:08:05.618 --> 00:08:07.353
from countries like Norway
and fewer people

00:08:07.353 --> 00:08:08.554
from what he infamously called

00:08:08.554 --> 00:08:10.255
[bleep]hole countries
like those in Africa.

00:08:10.255 --> 00:08:13.192
Obviously those comments have
prompted accusations of racism,

00:08:13.192 --> 00:08:15.294
but don't worry --
Trump's son Don Jr.

00:08:15.294 --> 00:08:18.330
came charging to his defense
this week claiming his father

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:21.033
can't be racist
because he knows rappers.

00:08:21.033 --> 00:08:23.236
-It's been terrible to watch,
because I know him.

00:08:23.236 --> 00:08:24.570
I've seen him my whole life.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.838
I have seen the things
he has done.

00:08:25.838 --> 00:08:27.372
It is amazing,
all of the rappers,

00:08:27.372 --> 00:08:29.508
all of the this,
all his African-American friends

00:08:29.508 --> 00:08:31.410
from Jesse Jackson
to Al Sharpton.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:33.412
You know, I have pictures
with them, my whole life.

00:08:33.412 --> 00:08:35.047
We say, "Hi,"
always been friends.

00:08:35.047 --> 00:08:37.383
It was only till he got into
politics that, all of a sudden,

00:08:37.383 --> 00:08:39.351
"Oh, he's the most terrible
human being in the world."

00:08:39.351 --> 00:08:41.186
-If someone mentions
black people,

00:08:41.186 --> 00:08:43.289
and the first thing
you think of is rappers,

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:44.890
you're probably racist.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:45.791
[ Laughter ]

00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:49.294
That's like saying, "Women?

00:08:49.294 --> 00:08:52.598
Women, sure,
I know lots of secretaries."

00:08:52.598 --> 00:08:54.333
[ Laughter ]

00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:56.134
But that's right,
Trump can't be a racist

00:08:56.134 --> 00:08:58.671
because he knows rappers.
He even has a rap name.

00:08:59.405 --> 00:09:01.206
[ Laughter ]

00:09:01.206 --> 00:09:03.476
So you got a White House that's
splitting its time

00:09:03.476 --> 00:09:05.044
between planning
military parades,

00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:07.045
lying about immigration,
and insulting DREAMers,

00:09:07.045 --> 00:09:08.714
and yet according to polls,
Republicans seem

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:10.515
more enthusiastic about Trump
than ever.

00:09:10.515 --> 00:09:11.817
A new poll this week found that

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:13.118
while Trump's overall approval

00:09:13.118 --> 00:09:14.719
rating is just 40%,

00:09:14.719 --> 00:09:15.821
his approval rating among

00:09:15.821 --> 00:09:17.923
Republicans has soared to 90%.

00:09:17.923 --> 00:09:20.059
And that illustrates a key point
about our current politics,

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:21.593
which is that Donald Trump
is very much

00:09:21.593 --> 00:09:23.862
the president Republicans want.
He's not an outlier.

00:09:23.862 --> 00:09:26.031
He's the culmination
of the modern GOP.

00:09:26.031 --> 00:09:28.700
Trump is massively
and historically unpopular

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:30.269
in general,
but among Republicans,

00:09:30.269 --> 00:09:32.704
he is exactly what they want
in a president of --

00:09:32.704 --> 00:09:34.473
-The United Shates.

00:09:34.473 --> 00:09:36.442
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:38.043 line:0%
♪♪

00:09:38.043 --> 00:09:39.545 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

